{"id":"466c0e77403665b802bb26381e527f63aff46bd4","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245763","title":"让 AI 做网页，总是有一股 AI 味道。看到那种圆角、漆黑网站就本能的反感。","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"tidilist","excerpt":"程序员 - @tidilist - 大家有没有收藏的干货，分享几个参考一下，想做个网站。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>大家有没有收藏的干货，分享几个参考一下，想做个网站。</p></div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/网页\"><li></li> 网页</a><a href=\"/tag/设计\"><li></li> 设计</a><a href=\"/tag/参考\"><li></li> 参考</a></P><p><span>77 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-01 09:25:05 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141068\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/dfdf70a3a83cd756509fac755b7160eb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fenglingyu\" data-uid=\"447489\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fenglingyu\">fenglingyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 11:24:44 +08:00\">23h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>随便给个自己觉得好的网站让它参考，然后禁止它用毛玻璃特效应该就行了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141071\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7460/e1cd/274090_normal.png?m=1765551963\" alt=\"Danswerme\" data-uid=\"274090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Danswerme\">Danswerme</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 11:24:51 +08:00\">23h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/SleepyRaven\">SleepyRaven</a>  +1 ，点名 commandcode 官网，点进去漆黑一片，没有切换亮色的开关。 文档又提供了亮色模式切换开关，不是所有人都喜欢暗黑模式。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141085\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/06bc/eb98/679304_normal.png?m=1782664383\" alt=\"osilinka\" data-uid=\"679304\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/osilinka\">osilinka</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 11:26:39 +08:00\">23h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>其实这个就是 AI 比较傻逼的地方</p><p>大部分人其实不喜欢 night mode</p><p>AI 偏偏把程序员的偏好强加给所有人</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141091\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c0/4118/1055_normal.png?m=1784773572\" alt=\"diudiuu\" data-uid=\"1055\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/diudiuu\">diudiuu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 11:27:39 +08:00\">23h 11m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在这找找提示词帖子，我记得有</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141162\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1ac9/be13/420212_normal.png?m=1786001011\" alt=\"edgeedge\" data-uid=\"420212\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edgeedge\">edgeedge</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 11:38:28 +08:00\">23h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>另外预取方面，花了不少心思：可以先给 url 分类，按分类设置预取策略：<br>站点部署后，用户浏览器加载一个页面时，页面上的某类 url 超链接目标页，会自动下载，等用户点击时，秒开（页面已经预取、缓存到本地）</p><p>预取策略可以配置，分几个档次：页面加载完成既自动加载、在页面上可见时自动加载、鼠标扫过/悬停时……</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141240\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bad/8a20/441003_normal.png?m=1716075803\" alt=\"ebushicao\" data-uid=\"441003\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ebushicao\">ebushicao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 11:54:13 +08:00\">22h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你想做什么类型的网站，就让 AI 给你找下都有哪些热门的网站，然后你选个你觉得不错的让 AI 参考就行。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141303\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6304/a0ce/532512_normal.png?m=1733319904\" alt=\"Lukedis\" data-uid=\"532512\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Lukedis\">Lukedis</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 12:10:40 +08:00\">22h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>难道不应该自己出设计图，AI 做实现方案吗，AI 做的设计，本身就 AI 味很重</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141315\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/eebade5db3a4bc344a66749f387c1a6a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ohoh\" data-uid=\"106349\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ohoh\">ohoh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 12:13:51 +08:00\">22h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你只是审美疲劳了，AI 做得至少超过了 99%的人了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141331\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8fea/8dd3/162504_normal.png?m=1787038367\" alt=\"chunqiuyiyu\" data-uid=\"162504\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chunqiuyiyu\">chunqiuyiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 12:21:32 +08:00\">22h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>写出来还是要自己调整的，这是我最近用 AI 做一个发布页，我感觉还行 ![]( <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/u7uWGSB.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u7uWGSB.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>)</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141350\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/815c/83fe/246175_normal.png?m=1757572582\" alt=\"Wincer\" data-uid=\"246175\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Wincer\">Wincer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 12:30:22 +08:00\">22h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这题我会，你让 ai 先画一个原型出来，不满意就调整，满意了再让他对着原型开始实现功能，一旦让他开始实现，他就会更偏向于功能而不是设计上的实现了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141356\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8b1d/4dae/24205_normal.png?m=1690099088\" alt=\"coffish\" data-uid=\"24205\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coffish\">coffish</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 12:33:27 +08:00\">22h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>特大标题，不是左对齐就是居中。<br>圆角方块<br>暗黑模式<br>一个长页，没有分栏</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141372\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c5e/e782/494190_normal.png?m=1696749449\" alt=\"yolee599\" data-uid=\"494190\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yolee599\">yolee599</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 12:44:41 +08:00\">21h 54m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>大圆角，毛玻璃，发光边框，红紫色动效……看到都想吐了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141577\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6aed2195478ad79d70380d0b0433b8d6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tidilist\" data-uid=\"795851\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tidilist\">tidilist</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 13:53:17 +08:00\">20h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Lukedis\">Lukedis</a>  自己又要去想，能有那种可以参考的聚合站我感觉还挺好。会让 AI 给一些 html 的 demo ，但是不是很满意。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141875\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2701/ecad/352047_normal.png?m=1776995669\" alt=\"JZen\" data-uid=\"352047\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JZen\">JZen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 14:46:16 +08:00\">19h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不要让 AI 去做设计就不会有 AI 味，要么让它改模板，要么自己设计让 AI 去实现</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141897\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b7f7/457f/251555_normal.png?m=1666662675\" alt=\"HeyWeGo\" data-uid=\"251555\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HeyWeGo\">HeyWeGo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 14:49:00 +08:00\">19h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ai 只是提高底线，上限制作人自己决定</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        